' Native finite located OSLF evidence boundary. Admission uses authenticated
' pre-state supply plus a conservative external reservation. Exact runtime and
' replay evidence alone may witness a graded spend and its post-state.
'
' Source of truth: accounting/oslf.rs, CAOSLFSpatialModal.v,
'                  OslfLocatedTyping.tla.
' Palette: authenticated/exact=mint #C8E6C9 · conservative=amber #FFE082
'          forbidden=red #EF9A9A · formula/check=blue #BBDEFB
' Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/theory/diagrams/oslf-evidence-boundary.puml

@startuml oslf-evidence-boundary
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "sans-serif"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #BBDEFB
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #333333
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #666666
title Located OSLF evidence boundary — safety from bounds, modal truth from exact replay

start
:authenticated pre-state supply Σ_I; <<#C8E6C9>>
:native structural analysis computes\nexternal reservation Δ_I^max; <<#FFE082>>
note right
  Candidate-created stacks are excluded.
  Only already-authenticated custody is Σ_I.
end note
if (formula kind?) then (Sufficient)
  if (Σ_I >= Δ_I^max ?) then (yes)
    :Satisfied\nbecause Δ_I^actual <= Δ_I^max; <<#C8E6C9>>
  else (no)
    :Unsatisfied; <<#EF9A9A>>
  endif
else (Required / Spend)
  :Indeterminate — a maximum is not\nevidence that a COMM occurred; <<#FFE082>>
endif

:bounded execution records exact\ncausal authority events; <<#BBDEFB>>
:independent replay authenticates\nΔ_I^actual and event order; <<#C8E6C9>>
if (exact grade available in\nboth Σ_I and Δ_I^actual ?) then (yes)
  :consume grade from supply and demand; <<#C8E6C9>>
  :check continuation against the\nexact post-spend observation; <<#C8E6C9>>
else (no)
  :Unsatisfied; <<#EF9A9A>>
endif
stop

legend bottom
  |= color |= meaning |
  |<#C8E6C9>| authenticated or exact evidence |
  |<#FFE082>| conservative bound / indeterminate result |
  |<#BBDEFB>| formula decision or replay observation |
  |<#EF9A9A>| rejected or disproved claim |
endlegend

@enduml
